e Blender 5.1.0 still can.\n(I still use Blender as HDR test.)\nUnfortunately I haven't decided yet whether to report that bug to them.\n\nCurrently I can do tests with Ubuntu 25.04, 25.10, and 26.04, if necessary.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4444014875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4444059499","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118480#issuecomment-4444059499","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118480","id":4444059499,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCOL3aw","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-13T18:23:14Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T18:23:14Z","body":"> I guess for posterity: does this issue persist on 26.04?\n\nAccording to [this discussion](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118480#issuecomment-4244403920), this issue has never been reproducible with Ubuntu 26.04.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4444059499/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4444153904","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118480#issuecomment-4444153904","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118480","id":4444153904,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCORoMA","user":{"login":"fichtenmayermario","id":275420323,"node_id":"U_kgDOEGqUow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275420323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fichtenmayermario","html_url":"https://github.com/fichtenmayermario","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fichtenmayermario/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fichtenmayermario/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fichtenmayermario/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fichtenmayermario/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fichtenmayermario/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fichtenmayermario/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fichtenmayermario/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fichtenmayermario/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fichtenmayermario/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-13T18:35:37Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T18:35:37Z","body":"Godot 4.7 beta 2 HDR works with Ubuntu 26.04 (Gnome 50), yes.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4444153904/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462291403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118480#issuecomment-4462291403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118480","id":4462291403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCfkpyw","user":{"login":"LiterallyAClown","id":9020266,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMjAyNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9020266?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiterallyAClown","html_url":"https://github.com/LiterallyAClown","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiterallyAClown/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiterallyAClown/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiterallyAClown/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiterallyAClown/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiterallyAClown/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiterallyAClown/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiterallyAClown/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiterallyAClown/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiterallyAClown/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-15T18:30:25Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T18:30:25Z","body":"Just a small comment after encountering the same issue with kde: for some reason in kde's HDR calibration settings, I had set the same value for max luminance and reference luminance. As a result window_is_hdr_output_supported() was returning false.\n\nSo you can get in a situation where HDR is enabled successfully in the window manager, but unavailable in godot due to a user setting. Now does max lumlnance = ref luminance makes any sense? I don't know, but kde's HDR calibration allows the user to do it anyway.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462291403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462328626","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118480#issuecomment-4462328626","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118480","id":4462328626,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCfm7Mg","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-15T18:35:44Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T18:35:44Z","body":"We had this issue brought up previously and one of the developers of KDE Plasma specified that max luminance > ref luminance should be our check for HDR support because there's no other way for us to tell that we're actually in HDR mode instead of SDR with some arbitrary brightness setting. With a formal protocol amendment it might be possible but otherwise it's not something we can support.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462328626/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4612568163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118480#issuecomment-4612568163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118480","id":4612568163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEu40Yw","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T13:01:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T13:02:09Z","body":"So if I'm reading the conversation correctly, I think the outcome is:\n- Working as expected on GNOME in Ubuntu 26.04+\n- Still broken in Ubuntu 25.04 and 25.10, but we don't necessarily plan to add support for those, as this is fairly cutting edge anyway for Wayland\n- Recent KDE works but may have some configuration issues limiting the functionality\n\nSo I'd suggest we close the issue as \"won't fix\" (or fixed in Ubuntu 26.04), but properly document the configuration requirements for HDR to work on KDE (and possibly other DEs).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4612568163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4613049122","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118480#issuecomment-4613049122","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118480","id":4613049122,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEvWLIg","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T13:51:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T13:51:31Z","body":"Yes, this is definitely a “won’t fix” and is a bug that is specific to GNOME 48 and also probably GNOME 49. It does not reproduce is GNOME 47 or earlier because those don’t have HDR support. It does not happen in GNOME 50 or later because the bug is fixed in GNOME 50 (We still haven’t tested GNOME 49, but I think [this](https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/issues/4438) suggests it was fixed in GNOME 50). This means the bug in GNOME spanned 1 year, from March 2025 to March 2026.\n\nSo a documentation note could be added that HDR output is not supported on GNOME versions 48 and 49 due to a bug in those two versions of GNOME.\n\nThis sounds basically the same as a driver bug where the fix is to simply update to the latest version (I believe we normally don’t document all of these?) There’s a bit of a rabbit hole for documenting every known external graphics driver/API bug that’s been fixed by the latest version, so maybe this note could just be temporary until most everyone’s updated… (Or maybe everyone has updated now? I don’t fully understand the spread and persistence of GNOME 48 and 49 and its intersection with users who are targeting HDR output.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4613049122/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4613757285","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118480#issuecomment-4613757285","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118480","id":4613757285,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEwBZZQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T15:01:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T15:01:29Z","body":"Yeah I agree in general we don't document temporary driver bugs or similar. Here updating to the latest version is not something that can typically be done by users though, short of upgrading distro, so I see it more like specifying what are the minimal requirements to run Godot with HDR output.\n\nSince this is fairly new technology (at least judging by the state of its support in Wayland compositors), I think it's reasonable to flag that to end users so they know what to expect.\n\nSo https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/rendering/hdr_output.html#hdr-output could have a `.. note::` alongside what platforms are supported with some caveats about min supported versions for common environments.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4613757285/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4653385412","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118480#issuecomment-4653385412","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118480","id":4653385412,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFV0GxA","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"n